NOTE ON THE FAIR HOUSING AND COMPLIANCE SCORERS

The pattern gates in edp_evals/scorers/fair_housing.py and
edp_evals/scorers/compliance.py encode one broker's reading of the Fair
Housing Act, HUD guidance, and the federal Lead-Based Paint Disclosure Rule.
They are a testing aid, not legal advice, and they are demonstrably
incomplete -- the meta-tests in tests/ exist precisely because phrasings slip
past them. Do not treat a passing run as a compliance certification. Consult
counsel for your own jurisdiction and portfolio.
